{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_0168p2ubN9ZJdFioUSc6m5Yb", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olestra\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.mentalfloss.com/food/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/619261/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s\"}, {\"url\": \"https://diyhpl.us/~bryan/irc/extropians/www.lucifer.com/exi-lists/extropians.1Q01/4054.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Olestra\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digitalcommons.unl.edu/extensionhist/1911/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://agris.fao.org/search/ar/records/65df424b0f3e94b9e5d6b3f3\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.hoover.org/node/39757\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://cei.org/opeds_articles/fda-fails-to-give-olestra-fair-weight-henry-miller-la-times-op-ed/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:07:09.623Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "FDA approved olestra savory snacks year", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01GEuguNzQyQwJFxvUdPB45B", "content": [{"title": "Olestra", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olestra"}, {"title": "olestra fat free snack controversy 1990s", "url": "https://www.mentalfloss.com/food/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s"}, {"title": "olestra fat free snack controversy 1990s", "url": "https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/619261/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s"}, {"title": "BIO/LAW: FDA and Olestra", "url": "https://diyhpl.us/~bryan/irc/extropians/www.lucifer.com/exi-lists/extropians.1Q01/4054.html"}, {"title": "www.wikipedia.com", "url": "https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Olestra"}, {"title": "Extension, Cooperative", "url": "https://digitalcommons.unl.edu/extensionhist/1911/"}, {"title": "Olestra: a new food additive", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/ar/records/65df424b0f3e94b9e5d6b3f3"}, {"title": "- Law & Policy", "url": "https://www.hoover.org/node/39757"}, {"title": "www.govinfo.gov", "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf"}, {"title": "FDA Fails to Give Olestra Fair Weight: Henry Miller LA Times Op-Ed", "url": "https://cei.org/opeds_articles/fda-fails-to-give-olestra-fair-weight-henry-miller-la-times-op-ed/"}]}, "The FDA approved olestra for savory snacks in **1996**. The approval came after Procter & Gamble narrowed its request to that category. The sources give slightly different dates for the decision:\n\n- **Dates:** One source says the Food and Drug Administration (FDA) approved another fat substitute called Olestra on January 24, 1996. A Federal Register notice says the approval was published in the January 30, 1996 final rule, and a historical article dates the FDA's conclusion to January 25, 1996.\n- **Scope:** The approval covered prepackaged ready-to-eat savory snacks, such as chips and crackers, used as a fat replacement.\n- **Later change:** In 2003 the FDA removed the specific label requirement for olestra savory snack products, following a petition from P&G.\n- **Market status:** Wikipedia says no olestra products were sold in the US as of 2023, but that claim is tagged \"citation needed,\" so I'd treat it as unverified."], "durationSeconds": 5.711510875, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_0168p2ubN9ZJdFioUSc6m5Yb", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDYH3THrTuYS6oYo2QH5", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：1996 年**\n\n1996 年 1 月，FDA 批准 olestra 用作预包装即食咸味零食（如薯片、饼干）里的脂肪替代品。各来源给的具体日期略有出入：有的写 1 月 24 日，有的写 1 月 25 日；联邦公报（Federal Register）里的最终规则是 1996 年 1 月 30 日发布的。\n\n共搜索 1 次。\n\n依据：\n- [Olestra – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olestra)\n- [Federal Register 2003-08-05（govinfo）](https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf)\n- [Mental Floss：olestra 1990s controversy](https://www.mentalfloss.com/food/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1053, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4293, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1053}, "output_tokens": 307, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:07:13.583Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDYH3AAin9JAe5TqFvJR"}
